@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Tahoma
title Bill request -> Payment -> explicit close (actual locks)
autonumber
actor Customer
actor SERVICE_STAFF as Staff
control CustomerBillingService as CB
control "BillingPreviewService / BillingEngine" as Bill
participant "DatabaseBillingContextProvider\nDiningSessionBillingReader" as Read
control PaymentServiceImpl as Pay
control DiningSessionServiceImpl as Session
participant DatabasePaymentStatusLookup as Lookup
database DB
Customer -> CB : POST /dining-sessions/{id}/bill-request\ncustomer cookie + Origin
group transaction / session row lock
 CB -> DB : findByIdForUpdate / refresh lock
 CB -> CB : recheck credential and ACTIVE
 CB -> DB : requestBill() sets bill_requested_at once
 CB -> Read : trusted opening snapshot + counts
 CB -> Bill : calculate(context)
end
CB --> Customer : REQUESTED + BillSummary
note over CB,DB : Same lock as Order/Payment/close. Later Orders ->409.\nRepeated bill request keeps original timestamp; session remains ACTIVE.
Staff -> Bill : POST /billing/preview {sessionId}\nSERVICE_STAFF login cookie
Bill -> Read : snapshot context (not browser-supplied amount)
Bill --> Staff : rounded BillSummary
Staff -> Pay : GET /payments/sessions/{sessionId}\ncheck existing payment before retry
Staff -> Pay : POST /payments {sessionId,paymentMethod}
group payment transaction / same session row lock
 Pay -> DB : lock and refresh session
 Pay -> Pay : require ACTIVE + billRequestedAt + no existing payment
 Pay -> Read : findBySessionId; require matching id
 Pay -> Bill : calculate total from snapshot
 Pay -> DB : insert PAID amount + paidAt; unique session_id
end
Pay --> Staff : 201 PaymentResult with recorded amount
note over Pay,Session : PAID does not close; duplicate Payment ->409.\nIf POST response lost, recover by GET; never auto-retry POST.
Staff -> Session : POST /dining-sessions/{id}/close
group close transaction
 Session -> DB : lock ACTIVE session
 Session -> Lookup : findPaymentForSession(id)
 Lookup -> DB : read payment
 Lookup --> Session : same sessionId + PAID
 Session -> DB : lock table / delete all grants\ncomplete session + table AVAILABLE
end
Session --> Staff : DiningSessionResponse COMPLETED
Customer -> CB : GET /bill-status with old cookie
CB --> Customer : rejected after close
note over CB,DB : Bill-status polling every5s while page visible.\nPAID response uses recorded amount; see revision-scoped public reports for acceptance.
@enduml
